    "note": "DERIVED from SAP's published policies: requirement ids, titles, priority tiers and config-store names only. SAP's SQL predicates are NOT reproduced and are NOT executed — they run against Focused Run's configuration database, which we do not have. Our checks read exported files and are our own.",
