      }
    },
    "unit_warning": "These are CHECK ITEMS in the CSA policies, not the 'control points' counted in the Baseline document — the widely-quoted 214 (69/92/53) is that other unit. The two do not reconcile; do not publish a percentage of one against the other.",
    "policy_without_a_requirement": "1OSECUPD (WEBDISP_ALL) is the one policy of 58 that yields no requirement, and it is SAP's file rather than a gap in the builder: its check item carries the POLICY id as its id attribute instead of a requirement-shaped one like SECUPD-O_a.1, so there is nothing to derive a requirement from. Verified against BaselinePolicies/SOS/v2.4/WEBDISP_ALL/1OSECUPD.xml on 2026-08-18. Recorded here so the next reader does not re-open it as our bug."
